{
  "_readme": [
    "Hand-written license-clean subset of the ESCO/O*NET-SOC 2019 crosswalk, for CI.",
    "Identifiers and codes only -- no descriptions, no publisher prose (ADR-0006 d.7).",
    "The cast is chosen to exercise the three ways this crosswalk can go wrong:",
    "  1. Trailing-zero hazard. ESCO 0110.10 (lieutenant) IS in the published table;",
    "     0110.1 (air force officer) is NOT. Numeric parsing would merge them and",
    "     silently give 'air force officer' three US police occupations.",
    "  2. Mixed key levels. 2512 is an ISCO group code, 2512.4 an ESCO occupation.",
    "     Same column in the source file, different node labels in the graph.",
    "  3. Many-to-many. 2512.4 (software developer) maps to four O*NET occupations.",
    "     Row 9999.9 is present in the table but absent from ESCO: a version seam."
  ],
